{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fly to Death!</strong> is a thrilling free-to-play arcade game where every second counts!<br>Soar through deadly obstacles in two intense modes: complete hand-crafted levels or go for the highest score in endless mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock tons of <strong>unique characters</strong> and <strong>customize them</strong> with fun accessories. Want more? Use the built-in <strong>Level Creator</strong> to design your own challenges and <strong>publish them online</strong> for the world to play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 Simple to play, hard to master.<br>\ud83c\udfae Fast-paced action.<br>\ud83c\udfa8 Customize &amp; create.<br>\ud83c\udf0d Compete, share, and survive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to fly... or die?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Dead Bird","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3875940/7ede53ad3c7ee0447cbc88fab5bb522c1485d59c.jpg"},{"name":"Coin Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3875940/2ce1dc837e21d22d9808a3b9081373cf58383e54.jpg"},{"name":"Pro Coin Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3875940/2ce1dc837e21d22d9808a3b9081373cf58383e54.jpg"},{"name":"Rich Bird","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3875940/a72235dc5fe2b990486a8e53970ef7ad0f64cb18.jpg"},{"name":"Task Expert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3875940/fa5484f20639c108195ac2e25043b994827c5c12.jpg"},{"name":"Gems Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3875940/f5e3bf029afb4706e4a0d04959981735e4a6f7d4.jpg"},{"name":"Challenger","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3875940/561a455b14da016e392335e1766cb63d0363dd06.jpg"},{"name":"Beginner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcomm